{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Psycled 是一款以 AI 協助記錄每日心情、整理情緒與回顧生活軌跡的日誌 App，適合想更瞭解自己感受與行為模式的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-133.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄心情與情緒模式</h2>\n<p>你可先寫下當天發生的事與感受，再標記情緒、人物、地點和活動；需要時讓 AI 協助梳理文字中的情緒訊號。App 會依據認知行為治療提供問題與建議，幫你換個角度理解想法，並整理常見情緒、情境關聯、常用詞彙與過往日誌。它並非醫療裝置，AI 回饋可能不準確，只宜作自我反思。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-16.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-17.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-18.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-19.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-20.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-21.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Psycled – AI Journal &amp; Mood</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/psycled-ai-journal-mood/id6759551432?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.473262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:28:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:58.117627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:25.416586+00:00","content_hash":"fb631ef61a2a48e0c55826cf284cdab5ea0314677b2762703d8d483c1c9efb39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}